! Research Library Plugin

Display research papers with filtering, abstracts, and KaTeX math support.

!! Usage

Create research tiddlers with the `Research` tag and these fields:

* `authors` - Author names
* `abstract` - Paper abstract
* `pdf` - PDF link
* `arxiv` - arXiv link
* `link` - General link
* `tags` - Topic tags (chaos, renormalization, symbolic-dynamics, CE1, field-equations, fractals)

!! Widget Syntax

Display all research papers:

```
<$research-library filter="[tag[Research]]" />
```

With filters hidden:

```
<$research-library filter="[tag[Research]]" showFilters="no" />
```

Filter by topic:

```
<$research-library filter="[tag[Research]tag[chaos]]" />
```

!! Math Support

The plugin integrates with KaTeX for mathematical expressions. Use standard KaTeX syntax in your paper tiddlers:

```
Inline math: $E = mc^2$

Block math:
$$
\int_{-\infty}^{\infty} e^{-x^2} dx = \sqrt{\pi}
$$
```

!! Features

* Topic-based filtering
* Abstract display
* PDF, arXiv, and general links
* Tag display
* Full paper viewing
* KaTeX math rendering


